Context from Slack — DM between Tomás Reyes and Derek Miles (Apr 9, 2026, 8:02 AM):
@tomas.reyes: Derek, I really need this Apex deal. $1.6M. If we reprice at new floors the blended goes to $32.60 and Dentsu will walk. They have a competing offer from Hulu at $29.
@derek.miles: What if you restructure the mix? Drop premium to 45%, bump RON to 55%. Gets you to ~$29.20 blended at new floor rates.
@tomas.reyes: That changes the whole package value prop. Apex specifically wants majority premium for their EV launch.
@derek.miles: Then you might need to go ask for a one-time exception. VP approval I think?
@tomas.reyes: :pray:

